{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgksGsHvpn6Yce92vzyFc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I'd tell my son:**\n\n\"I haven't decided anything. I'll ask you first, and then the bank. From what I read, this קרן כספית is something like a deposit. They said it's 'סיכון נמוך', you can take the money out 'בכל יום מסחר', and the box said 3.25% a year next to 1.8% for a one-year deposit. That's a lot more, and it caught my eye. But it also said 'אין תשואה מובטחת'. And then they wrote that the fund is 'אין ביטוח', and that a deposit at the bank isn't insured either. That frightened me. I never knew that about my deposits. The fees I didn't understand. There's a table with six kinds of charges, and every one says 'אין תקרה בחוק'. I didn't find one number telling me what I'd actually pay. The site is called 'מקור', and I've never heard of it. So I'm not touching anything until someone I trust explains it.\"\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** It's dark, with small light letters. I read the heading \"קרן כספית\" and the first lines, \"סיכון נמוך\", \"מק\"מ ופיקדונות בנקאים\", so it seemed meant for me. In \"למה משתמשים בזה\" I liked \"כסף שצריך להישאר זמין... בלי נעילה\". There was a lot about tax, 15% and 25%, and I didn't follow it.\n- **Screen 2:** The coloured bars. I looked for the sentence that explains them and found it: \"הריבית הגבוהה ביותר שמחזירה את הכסף בזמן: קרן כספית יומית, 3.25%\". I didn't open \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\". I skimmed \"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע\".\n- **Screen 3:** The fees table, full of English codes like MF-16 and BRK-17. I didn't find a percentage in it. The tax cards I skimmed. Then \"סיכונים\": \"אין ערבות של המדינה... וגם לפיקדונות בבנק אין ביטוח\". That's where I got worried.\n- **Screen 4:** The word list. I glanced at it, but by then I was tired and stopped. I never opened screen 5.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** נאמן, מק\"מ, ריאלי, נומינלי, השעה היעודה, מפיץ, קרן כספית מתחדשת, ריבית בנק ישראל, \"חבר בורסה\", and the codes MF-11, MF OQ3, TXS-24, BANK-18. I also don't know what the \"123\" buttons at the top are for.\n\n**What I couldn't read:** the small grey print under the bars, and the note under the table. Pale letters on black are hard for me even with my glasses."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3581,"cache_read_input_tokens":14635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3581},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d2ff24c-de26-4fd4-8e83-518806023858","uuid":"72d8a833-1211-47ca-8932-9d6a53a01480","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:14:54.105Z","request_id":"req_011CgksGs62emqUGamhPfCLt"}
